msgid "可视化（26 项）"
msgstr "Visualization (26 items)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:4
msgid "在图像和视频中对检测结果进行可视化显示。"
msgstr "Visualize detection results in images and videos."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:42
msgid ":ref:`背景颜色`"
msgstr ":ref:`Background color`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:44
msgid "在图像中，用选择覆盖所有检测到的区域以外的区域"
msgstr ""
"In the image, cover all areas outside the detected areas with a selection"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:45
msgid ":ref:`模糊显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Blurred display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:47
msgid "在图像中检测到的对象运行模糊处理"
msgstr "Run blurring on detected objects in the image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:48
msgid ":ref:`边界框显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Bounding box display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:50
msgid "在图像中检测到的对象周围绘制矩形"
msgstr "Draw rectangles around detected objects in the image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:51
msgid ":ref:`圆形显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Circular display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:53
msgid "在图像中检测到的对象周围绘制圆形"
msgstr "Draw circles around detected objects in the image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:54
msgid ":ref:`分类显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Category display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:56
msgid "可视化单标签或多标签分类结果，并支持自定义显示选项"
msgstr ""
"Visualize single-label or multi-label classification results and support "
"custom display options"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:57
msgid ":ref:`颜色显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Color display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:59
msgid "在图像中检测到的对象上绘制颜色"
msgstr "Draw colors on detected objects in the image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:60
msgid ":ref:`角显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Corner display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:62
msgid "在图像中检测到的对象的角绘制矩形"
msgstr "Draw a rectangle at the corners of detected objects in the image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:63
msgid ":ref:`裁剪显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Crop display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:65
msgid "在场景中绘制放大后的检测作物"
msgstr "Draw an enlarged detection crop in the scene"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:66
msgid ":ref:`仪表板可视化`"
msgstr ":ref:`Dashboard Visualization`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:68
msgid "对预测结果进行可视化，可用于在仪表板显示。"
msgstr "Visualize prediction results and display them on a dashboard."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:69
msgid ":ref:`点显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Point display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:71
msgid "根据提供的检测结果，在图像的特定坐标标位置绘制点"
msgstr ""
"Draw points at specific coordinate positions in the image based on the "
"provided detection results."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:72
msgid ":ref:`椭圆显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`ellipse display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:74
msgid "在图像中检测到的对象周围绘制椭圆"
msgstr "Draw ellipses around detected objects in the image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:75
msgid ":ref:`网格显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Grid display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:77
msgid "以网格形式显示图像数组"
msgstr "Display array of images in grid form"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:78
msgid ":ref:`显示光环`"
msgstr ":ref:`Show halo`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:80
msgid "在图像中检测到的对象周围绘制光晕"
msgstr "Draw halos around detected objects in the image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:81
msgid ":ref:`图标显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Icon display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:83
msgid "在图像中根据检测结果或成或特定静态标位置绘制图标"
msgstr ""
"Draw an icon in the image based on the detection result or specific static "
"marker position"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:84
msgid ":ref:`关键显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Key display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:86
msgid "在图像中检测到的对象上绘制关键支链"
msgstr "Draw critical branches on detected objects in the image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:87
msgid ":ref:`标签显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Tag display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:89
msgid "根据提供的检测结果，在图像的特定坐标标位置绘制标签"
msgstr ""
"Draw labels at specific coordinate positions in the image based on the "
"provided detection results."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:90
msgid ":ref:`线条计数显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Line count display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:92
msgid "在图像/视频上绘制计数线，统计目标穿过线段的次数，可用于越界/流量统计场景。"
msgstr ""
"Draw a counting line on the image/video to count the number of times the "
"target crosses the line segment, which can be used in cross-border/traffic "
"statistics scenarios."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:93
msgid ":ref:`遮罩显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Mask display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:95
msgid "在图像中检测到的对象上应用遮罩"
msgstr "Apply a mask on detected objects in the image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:96
msgid ":ref:`模型对比显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Model comparison display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:98
msgid "Visualize the difference between two models' detections."
msgstr "Visualize the difference between two models' detections."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:99
msgid ":ref:`像素显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Pixel display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:101
msgid "在图像中检测到的对象进行像素化处理"
msgstr "Pixelate detected objects in images"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:102
msgid ":ref:`多边形显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Polygon display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:104
msgid "在图像中检测到的对象周围绘制多边形"
msgstr "Draw polygons around detected objects in the image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:105
msgid ":ref:`多边形区域显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Polygon area display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:107
msgid "在图像中多边形区域上应用遮罩"
msgstr "Apply a mask to a polygonal area in an image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:108
msgid ":ref:`参考路径显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Reference path display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:110
msgid "在图像中绘制参考路径"
msgstr "Draw reference paths in images"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:111
msgid ":ref:`轨迹显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Trajectory display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:113
msgid "根据检测跟踪结果绘制轨迹"
msgstr "Draw trajectories based on detection and tracking results"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:114
msgid ":ref:`三角显示`"
msgstr ":ref:`Triangle display`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:116
msgid "在图像中根据提供的检测结果，在特定坐标标位置绘制三角形标记"
msgstr ""
"Draw triangle marks at specific coordinate positions in the image based on "
"the provided detection results."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:117
msgid ":ref:`文本可视化`"
msgstr ":ref:`Text Visualization`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/index.rst:119
msgid "显示自定义文本覆盖层，支持多行文本和条件格式化"
msgstr ""
"Displays custom text overlays with support for multi-line text and "
"conditional formatting"
